The variance decomposition matches empirical to ~5%. The formula is:

**σ²_HL_Q(x, h-ensemble) = σ²_∞(x, h-ensemble) + (1/N)·Σ_{h: max_p>Q} (ε_Q(h)·li_2(x))²**

with ε_Q(h) = |S_∞(h) - S_Q(h)|. Predicted knee Q* ≈ √x/log x, exactly matching empirical.
